# ── Overrides for this folder ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Codemagic clones the repo onto a cloud Mac and runs `npm ci` there, which
# needs both files present. The root .gitignore no longer excludes them, so
# these two lines are belt-and-braces: they keep the iOS build working even if
# the root ever goes back to ignoring package manifests.
!package.json
!package-lock.json

# ── Generated ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# Rebuilt from the web project by sync-web-assets.mjs.
www/

# Transcoded background videos. Re-derived from backgroundloop/*.webm, and
# large enough that committing them would bloat the repo for no gain.
.video-cache/

# ── macOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
